{"seq":3,"slug":"industry-consortium-federation","title":"行业联防与隐私计算协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/intel-sharing-federation/industry-consortium-federation","wordCount":3600,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"行业联防与隐私计算协同\">行业联防与隐私计算协同</h1><p>前两篇的共享都发生在一套相对统一的治理边界内：一个平台与它的商户之间，或者一家公司的四个域之间。这一篇处理最难的一层——多家彼此独立、互为竞争对手的企业之间共享欺诈情报。这里的信任假设完全不同：参与方 A 不确定 B 会不会拿共享的数据做别的事，不确定 B 的数据质量，也不确定 B 会不会把从联防中得到的信息用于竞争。而参与方要回答的问题又恰恰需要跨方的数据：「这个设备在你们那边有没有出现过？」——这是一个典型的多方集合求交问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四种保护强度的协同形态\">核心概念：四种保护强度的协同形态</h2><p>按隐私保护强度递增、情报可用性递减，行业联防有四种可落地的形态。选择哪一种是设计的第一步，而不是最后一步。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>交换内容</th>\n<th>保护强度</th>\n<th>可用性</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>明文共享</td>\n<td>原始标识与标签</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>合规风险最高，几乎不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希集合共享</td>\n<td>加盐哈希后的标识</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>盐的管理；字典攻击风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有集合求交 PSI</td>\n<td>只暴露交集</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>计算与带宽成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联邦学习</td>\n<td>只暴露模型更新</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>非 IID、梯度泄露、协调成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"哈希共享为什么不够\">哈希共享为什么不够</h3><p>最直觉的做法是各方把自己本地的恶意标识哈希后交换，但它的保护强度远低于直觉：手机号、邮箱、设备 ID 的值空间不够大，攻击者可以枚举——把所有可能的手机号哈希一遍，与共享集合比对，就能还原出「谁在名单上」。行业里对这种「不可逆」的说法必须有免疫力：值空间小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>40</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{40}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">40</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的标识，加不加哈希都不构成保护。加盐能缓解，但引入新问题：各方用不同的盐则交集无法计算；用同一个共享盐则任何一方都能做枚举；交给可信第三方持盐，那个第三方就成了单点信任。这些都是真实取舍，不是可以绕过的工程细节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"psi-只暴露交集\">PSI：只暴露交集</h3><p>私有集合求交（PSI）解决的是这个问题：两方各自持有集合，计算它们的交集，但除了交集本身不泄露任何其他信息；在服务端-客户端的不对称变体里还可以做到只有客户端得知交集，服务端连交集都不知道（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Private_set_intersection\">Private set intersection</a>）。这正好匹配行业联防的典型场景——参与方 A 想知道「我的高风险设备里有多少也在 B 那边出现过」，但不希望 B 知道自己名单的完整内容。最经典的构造基于 Diffie-Hellman：双方各选秘密指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，对每个元素求幂后交换，再对收到的值求自己的幂，两边得到同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(\\cdot)^{ab}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，比对即得交集；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 保密，任何一方都无法从收到的幂值反推对方集合的元素。前提是底层群上计算离散对数困难。</p>\n<p>抽象的 PSI 不够用，实际行业联防需要的是带阈值的 PSI：不是「两方交集」，而是「有多少家参与方同时命中这个值」。这需要多方 PSI 或聚合式构造，复杂度随参与方数量上升，是这类方案的主要瓶颈。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PSI 变体</th>\n<th>泄露内容</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>主要瓶颈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两方明文比对</td>\n<td>双方完整集合</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>无隐私保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两方 PSI</td>\n<td>仅交集</td>\n<td>百万级元素</td>\n<td>带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带阈值多方 PSI</td>\n<td>仅满足阈值的值</td>\n<td>参与方数十、元素百万级</td>\n<td>复杂度随参与方数上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非对称 PSI</td>\n<td>仅客户端知交集</td>\n<td>亿级元素（分片）</td>\n<td>分片与结果重组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"联邦学习-共享模型而非数据\">联邦学习：共享模型而非数据</h3><p>联邦学习的思路是各方在本地数据上训练模型，只把模型更新发给协调方聚合，原始数据不出本地。经典的 FedAvg 就是这个模式：把当前模型发给选定的参与方，各方用本地数据训练若干轮，把更新回传，服务端平均这些更新得到新模型，重复多轮；论文报告在相同精度下，相比同步随机梯度下降可以把通信轮数降低 10 到 100 倍（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.05629\">McMahan et al., FedAvg</a>）。它的吸引力很直观：各家不交换任何用户标识，只交换「什么样的人可疑」的知识。但必须清楚它的三个硬约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第一个约束是非 IID。</strong> 不同平台的用户群、品类、欺诈类型差异很大，各方的本地数据分布严重不平衡且不独立同分布。FedAvg 在非 IID 下的收敛性远不如在 IID 下，聚合出的全局模型可能在每一方上都不如该方自己训练的模型。这是联邦学习落地最常见的失败原因，不是工程问题而是统计问题。</p>\n<p><strong>第二个约束是梯度泄露。</strong> 原始数据不出本地，不代表信息不出本地——梯度中包含训练样本的信息，恶意参与方可以从聚合梯度中反推出其他参与方的训练样本特征。防御手段是给梯度加噪声（差分隐私），但这会进一步损害精度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon,\\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私的定义是：对任意只差一条记录的相邻数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_1, D_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与任意输出集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ε</mi></msup><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[\\mathcal{A}(D_1) \\in S] \\le e^{\\varepsilon}\\Pr[\\mathcal{A}(D_2) \\in S] + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时是纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>-DP，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是近似 DP（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Differential_privacy\">Differential privacy</a>）；含义是无论攻击者掌握多少辅助信息，都无法可靠判断某一条特定记录是否在训练集中。记账规则决定了它能否用于多轮训练：顺序组合下对同一数据集执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-DP 机制，总损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，所以训练轮次越多隐私损失越大——联邦学习的多轮特性与 DP 的记账天然对立；并行组合下机制作用于不相交子集时总损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i \\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非求和，这解释了为什么联邦学习倾向于让参与方在本地多跑几轮再上传，而不是频繁上传小更新。</p>\n<p><strong>第三个约束是协调成本。</strong> 联邦学习需要所有参与方在同一轮上同步，而参与方的可用性、算力、网络都不可控。行业联防里的参与方是竞争对手，没有义务为联防的轮次调度让路。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def fedavg_round(parties, global_model, local_epochs, clip_norm, noise_sigma):&#10;    updates = []&#10;    for p in parties:&#10;        local = copy(global_model)&#10;        train_local(local, p.data, epochs=local_epochs)&#10;        delta = local - global_model&#10;        # 梯度裁剪限制单条样本影响，再按 L2 敏感度校准加入高斯噪声&#10;        delta = clip_by_norm(delta, clip_norm)&#10;        updates.append(delta + normal(0, noise_sigma * clip_norm, delta.shape))&#10;    return global_model + sum(updates) / len(updates)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fedavg_round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parties, global_model, local_epochs, clip_norm, noise_sigma):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parties:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> copy(global_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        train_local(local, p.data, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">local_epochs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> global_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 梯度裁剪限制单条样本影响，再按 L2 敏感度校准加入高斯噪声</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clip_by_norm(delta, clip_norm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        updates.append(delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, noise_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clip_norm, delta.shape))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> global_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(updates) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(updates)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>clip_norm</code> 与 <code>noise_sigma</code> 是一对相互拉扯的参数：裁剪越紧，单条记录对更新的影响上限越小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 敏感度越低），达到同样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 所需的噪声就越小，但模型精度也越差。这个权衡没有通用最优解，必须按各方的数据量与欺诈类型分布实测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种技术的组合使用\">三种技术的组合使用</h2><p>这三种技术不是互斥的，成熟方案往往是组合的：用 PSI 建立可信的负样本共识集（确定各方都确认的欺诈标识），用联邦学习训练模型（学习欺诈骗术的共同结构），用差分隐私给所有输出加噪声（防止从结果反推个体）。三者的分工可以这样理解——PSI 解决「我们有没有共同的坏人」，联邦学习解决「坏人长什么样」，差分隐私解决「答案会不会反过来暴露我的数据」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"psi-建共识集\">PSI 建共识集</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 带阈值的多方 PSI：只有达到 min_support 家的值才进入共识名单&#10;def threshold_psi(parties_blinded, min_support):&#10;    counts = Counter()&#10;    for blinded in parties_blinded:&#10;        for v in set(blinded):           # 各参与方内部先去重&#10;            counts[v] += 1&#10;    return {v for v, c in counts.items() if c &gt;= min_support}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 带阈值的多方 PSI：只有达到 min_support 家的值才进入共识名单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> threshold_psi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parties_blinded, min_support):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blinded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parties_blinded:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blinded):           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 各参与方内部先去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            counts[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counts.items() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_support}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>min_support</code> 是联防方案里最重要的旋钮。值设得低（2），共识名单大但每条可信度低，因为两家同时命中的一个值可能是共享的公共 IP；值设得高（4 以上），可信度高但覆盖率骤降，参与方少的小型联防根本凑不满。实用的做法是按参与方数量动态设定，并要求参与方数量至少是 <code>min_support</code> 的两倍——否则阈值约束了共识集的上限，联防在数学上无法产出结果。共识名单进入本地使用后，它的误伤回流机制与 <a href=\"../intel-governance/intel-falsepositive-quarantine\">误报隔离与申诉纠正</a> 定义的完全一致，区别只在于一条被推翻的共识结论会同时影响所有参与方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"联邦学习学模式-差分隐私保输出\">联邦学习学模式，差分隐私保输出</h3><p>共识集只覆盖已知标识，泛化不到新值。联邦学习补上这一块：各方本地训练、只交换模型更新，学到的是「什么样的行为组合可疑」这类可泛化的结构。这里的隐私保护依赖差分隐私加噪，而加噪强度与模型精度的权衡必须实测，没有通用最优解。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;consortium&quot;: &quot;cross-border-fraud-alliance&quot;,&#10;  &quot;protocol&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;identity&quot;: &quot;mTLS + member-signed request&quot;,&#10;    &quot;psi&quot;: { &quot;variant&quot;: &quot;threshold_multi&quot;, &quot;min_support&quot;: 3, &quot;hash&quot;: &quot;HMAC-SHA256&quot; },&#10;    &quot;fl&quot;: { &quot;rounds&quot;: 40, &quot;local_epochs&quot;: 3, &quot;clip_norm&quot;: 1.0, &quot;noise_sigma&quot;: 1.1 },&#10;    &quot;dp&quot;: { &quot;epsilon&quot;: 4.0, &quot;delta&quot;: 1e-5, &quot;accountant&quot;: &quot;rdp&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;governance&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;on_exit&quot;: &quot;purge_local_derived_state&quot;,&#10;    &quot;result_use&quot;: [&quot;manual_review&quot;, &quot;step_up_auth&quot;],&#10;    &quot;export_allowed&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;retention_days&quot;: 365&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consortium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross-border-fraud-alliance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"protocol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"identity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mTLS + member-signed request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"psi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"variant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"threshold_multi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_support\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HMAC-SHA256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rounds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local_epochs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"clip_norm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"noise_sigma\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"epsilon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accountant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rdp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"governance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_exit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"purge_local_derived_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"result_use\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manual_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"step_up_auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"export_allowed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"retention_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>export_allowed: false</code> 与 <code>result_use</code> 白名单是协议里最容易被省略、也最影响合规审查的两项。它们的作用是让「只用约定用途」成为可验证的属性，而不是一句承诺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信任假设必须写进协议\">信任假设必须写进协议</h2><p>行业联防最容易出问题的地方不是密码学，而是协议没有把信任假设写清楚。必须显式约定的事项至少包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事项</th>\n<th>为什么必须显式约定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与方的身份认证方式</td>\n<td>PSI 的中间值只能给已认证方，否则攻击者可冒充参与方套取幂值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否允许参与方退出并带走历史结果</td>\n<td>退出后带走共识名单等于免费获得他方数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果的使用范围</td>\n<td>共识名单是否可用于自动封禁，还是只能用于人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保留与删除</td>\n<td>协议终止后各方本地留存的哈希集合怎么处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>争议与举证</td>\n<td>某方提交脏数据污染共识名单时如何发现与追责</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一条尤其关键。PSI 的安全性依赖于参与方身份可信——如果攻击者能冒充一个参与方与合法参与方执行一次 PSI，它就能拿到合法的幂值集合，进而尝试离线攻击。因此参与方认证不是可选的运营环节，而是协议安全性的组成部分。第二条同样是安全条款而非行政条款：共识名单一旦形成就是一份高价值资产，如果成员可以在任何时候退出并保留它，那么加入联防的净收益就是「免费获得他方数据的合集」而成本为零——这个激励结构会让联防退化成「先加入、拿到名单、退出」。可行的约束是退出时清除派生状态，且历史查询结果不保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规接口的边界\">合规接口的边界</h2><p>行业联防的法律基础在不同法域差异很大，本 hub 不承担合规判定（那是 <code>140_crossborder-data-transfer-compliance</code> 的范围），但技术形态必须为合规留出接口。最实际的留白方式是：<strong>让「不共享原始数据」成为技术上的默认，而不是政策上的承诺</strong>。PSI 与联邦学习之所以在合规上比明文共享容易通过，正是因为它们把「不发送原始数据」变成了代码路径本身的属性——不是「我们承诺不发」，而是「协议里没有发原始数据的那一步」。这个差别在合规审查里是决定性的。同样的道理适用于结果的使用：如果共识名单在技术上只能被查询而不能被导出，那么「不用于其他目的」就是可验证的，而不是一句承诺。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可验证性需要三个技术支撑\">可验证性需要三个技术支撑</h3><p>把「技术默认」变成可被外部验证的属性，需要三件东西。第一是<strong>协议的消息序列可审计</strong>：一次 PSI 交互中实际传输了哪些字段，应当能被参与方各自记录并相互核对，任何一方试图传输额外数据都会在序列上留下痕迹。第二是<strong>结果接口的最小能力</strong>：查询接口只接受值、只返回结论，不提供「列出集合」或「导出区间」的能力，能力的最小化使滥用成为不可能而非违规。第三是<strong>退出后的可验证清除</strong>：成员退出时清除派生状态的声明需要一个可核对的机制，例如公布清除前后的状态摘要。三者合起来的含义是：合规不是靠声明说服审查者，而是靠系统的能力集合本身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[各方本地标识集合] --&gt; B[参与方身份认证]&#10;  B --&gt; C{协同形态选择}&#10;  C --&gt;|高覆盖优先| D[带阈值 PSI&lt;br/&gt;求共识名单]&#10;  C --&gt;|泛化能力优先| E[联邦学习&lt;br/&gt;本地训练 + 更新聚合]&#10;  D --&gt; F[差分隐私加噪输出]&#10;  E --&gt; G[梯度加噪&lt;br/&gt;epsilon-delta DP]&#10;  F --&gt; H[共识名单查询服务&lt;br/&gt;只查询不导出]&#10;  G --&gt; I[全局模型下发&lt;br/&gt;各方本地微调]&#10;  H --&gt; J[使用范围约束与审计]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[协议消息序列核对]&#10;  K --&gt; L[退出清除状态摘要]\">graph TD\n  A[各方本地标识集合] --&gt; B[参与方身份认证]\n  B --&gt; C{协同形态选择}\n  C --&gt;|高覆盖优先| D[带阈值 PSI&lt;br/&gt;求共识名单]\n  C --&gt;|泛化能力优先| E[联邦学习&lt;br/&gt;本地训练 + 更新聚合]\n  D --&gt; F[差分隐私加噪输出]\n  E --&gt; G[梯度加噪&lt;br/&gt;epsilon-delta DP]\n  F --&gt; H[共识名单查询服务&lt;br/&gt;只查询不导出]\n  G --&gt; I[全局模型下发&lt;br/&gt;各方本地微调]\n  H --&gt; J[使用范围约束与审计]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[协议消息序列核对]\n  K --&gt; L[退出清除状态摘要]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>行业联防有四种保护强度：明文、哈希集合、PSI、联邦学习。哈希集合的保护强度远低于直觉（值空间小可枚举），共享盐又会引入单点信任。</li>\n<li>PSI 的 DH 构造让双方只得到交集而不泄露其余元素；行业场景需要的是带阈值的多方 PSI，<code>min_support</code> 是最重要的旋钮，通常要求参与方数量至少是其两倍。</li>\n<li>联邦学习（FedAvg）报告同精度下通信轮数降低 10–100 倍，但受三个硬约束限制：非 IID 数据、梯度泄露（需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon,\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>-DP 加噪）、以及竞争对手间的协调成本；DP 的顺序组合与多轮训练天然对立，并行组合则解释了「本地多跑几轮再上传」的做法。</li>\n<li>三种技术应组合使用：PSI 建共识集、联邦学习学模式、差分隐私保输出。</li>\n<li>信任假设必须写进协议：参与方认证是协议安全的一部分，退出条款是激励结构的一部分，不是运营条款。</li>\n<li>让「不共享原始数据」成为技术默认而非政策承诺——协议里没有那一步，比承诺不发更有力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>情报一旦开始跨企业流动，误伤与泄密的后果都会被放大。这决定了最后一章不是可选的补充，而是第三章能持续存在的前提——见 <a href=\"../intel-governance/intel-falsepositive-quarantine\">误报隔离与申诉纠正</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行业联防与隐私计算协同","id":"行业联防与隐私计算协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四种保护强度的协同形态","id":"核心概念-四种保护强度的协同形态"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希共享为什么不够","id":"哈希共享为什么不够"},{"level":3,"text":"PSI：只暴露交集","id":"psi-只暴露交集"},{"level":3,"text":"联邦学习：共享模型而非数据","id":"联邦学习-共享模型而非数据"},{"level":2,"text":"三种技术的组合使用","id":"三种技术的组合使用"},{"level":3,"text":"PSI 建共识集","id":"psi-建共识集"},{"level":3,"text":"联邦学习学模式，差分隐私保输出","id":"联邦学习学模式-差分隐私保输出"},{"level":2,"text":"信任假设必须写进协议","id":"信任假设必须写进协议"},{"level":2,"text":"合规接口的边界","id":"合规接口的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"可验证性需要三个技术支撑","id":"可验证性需要三个技术支撑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交易/注册/营销/内容情报总线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/intel-sharing-federation/internal-risk-domain-bus"},"next":{"title":"误报隔离与申诉纠正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/intel-governance/intel-falsepositive-quarantine"}}